WEBVTT

01:41.160 --> 01:45.590
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.350 --> 01:50.660
[Episode 15]

02:14.590 --> 02:15.520
Tell me.

02:15.890 --> 02:19.480
What exactly happened to you in Baiyu Village?

02:25.150 --> 02:28.840
Miss Cuiyu, why did you go to Baiyu Village?

02:30.800 --> 02:33.410
I was looking for my disciple, Xiaotan.

02:34.579 --> 02:38.030
I came to Sky City, where humans and demons coexist peacefully

02:38.030 --> 02:39.790
to gather information,

02:40.030 --> 02:41.960
so I passed through Baiyu Village.

02:42.630 --> 02:44.520
On the mountain in Baiyu Village,

02:45.910 --> 02:48.510
I encountered Sun Yuanji, who had a broken leg.

02:49.060 --> 02:50.560
I helped him

02:50.870 --> 02:52.200
and stayed at his house.

02:52.700 --> 02:54.630
But they tried to harm me.

03:27.110 --> 03:30.020
A leech demon with such strong healing abilities.

03:30.220 --> 03:31.890
If we send her to Ma,

03:32.070 --> 03:34.440
he'll surely give us a good price.

03:36.150 --> 03:38.410
Speaking of which, what's the use of sending this demon

03:38.410 --> 03:39.670
to the Golden Dawn Inn?

03:40.960 --> 03:42.520
If you want to live long,

03:43.030 --> 03:44.240
don't ask

03:45.630 --> 03:46.760
what you shouldn't.

03:56.900 --> 03:58.090
Bro,

03:58.550 --> 04:00.420
this leech demon is so beautiful.

04:10.900 --> 04:13.010
Don't come any closer, don't come any closer.

04:13.010 --> 04:14.120
Don't come any closer.

04:14.120 --> 04:14.930
Don't come any closer!

04:14.930 --> 04:16.149
Don't come any closer!

04:16.149 --> 04:17.459
Don't come any closer.

04:18.120 --> 04:19.380
Don't come any closer.

04:19.750 --> 04:21.010
Don't come any closer.

04:34.120 --> 04:34.950
Continue.

04:45.870 --> 04:48.159
So, where did those three bastards from the Sun family

04:48.159 --> 04:49.390
take you?

04:51.040 --> 04:52.260
They...

04:52.930 --> 04:56.310
They took me to the Golden Dawn Inn.

04:57.880 --> 05:00.010
I was knocked out by some kind of smoke.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.130
I couldn't move my body,

05:04.920 --> 05:06.720
but I was conscious.

05:08.200 --> 05:11.580
They put me in a large vat.

05:11.830 --> 05:15.610
The liquid in the vat could submerge me completely.

05:16.040 --> 05:17.120
That liquid...

05:18.070 --> 05:19.070
It was very hot.

05:20.310 --> 05:21.870
As hot as fire.

05:24.510 --> 05:25.990
I could feel

05:26.360 --> 05:30.390
that scalding liquid enveloping my demon core,

05:30.810 --> 05:32.560
absorbing my demonic energy.

05:33.610 --> 05:34.970
Inside my body,

05:35.760 --> 05:38.690
another thing similar to a demon core formed.

05:39.570 --> 05:40.870
It was very hot,

05:41.370 --> 05:42.510
very volatile.

05:43.060 --> 05:43.850
Don't!

05:44.600 --> 05:45.800
Don't what?

05:47.050 --> 05:49.230
Don't come closer! I don't want to die!

05:49.270 --> 05:50.240
I want to live!

05:51.230 --> 05:52.690
Live for what?

05:52.710 --> 05:53.600
Revenge.

05:54.220 --> 05:56.700
To kill those ungrateful things.

06:01.430 --> 06:03.360
That's when I appeared.

06:04.700 --> 06:07.510
I escaped from there with Blue Eyes.

06:08.430 --> 06:09.920
I only remember one thing.

06:10.920 --> 06:12.040
Blue Eyes survived

06:13.240 --> 06:13.750
just to

06:13.750 --> 06:16.190
kill those ungrateful Sun family members.

06:18.070 --> 06:19.200
But she was too weak.

06:21.390 --> 06:22.920
I had just killed Sun Yuanli

06:24.240 --> 06:25.500
when Blue Eyes woke up.

06:26.270 --> 06:27.000
She...

06:27.720 --> 06:30.430
She ran away as if she had done something wrong.

06:46.360 --> 06:47.040
Yes,

06:48.920 --> 06:50.270
I killed him.

06:52.040 --> 06:54.190
I killed the village chief's son.

06:56.159 --> 06:57.800
But I don't regret it at all.

06:58.700 --> 06:59.950
Miss Cuiyu

07:00.870 --> 07:02.930
must have been at the Golden Dawn Inn,

07:03.190 --> 07:04.850
on the brink of life and death,

07:05.720 --> 07:07.180
when another her was born.

07:08.240 --> 07:09.800
So the key to everything

07:10.190 --> 07:12.190
must be at the Golden Dawn Inn.

07:13.270 --> 07:14.810
Take a look.

07:23.720 --> 07:24.750
Yitan.

07:24.770 --> 07:25.570
Look.

07:26.640 --> 07:28.100
The mark of the Mask Group.

07:47.610 --> 07:49.659
One o'clock, Lizi Hill.

07:51.710 --> 07:52.630
It's Hongye.

07:55.670 --> 07:56.950
One o'clock has already passed.

07:56.950 --> 07:57.880
Where's Hongye?

08:00.420 --> 08:01.210
Zui.

08:02.790 --> 08:04.120
There's a demonic aura.

08:09.250 --> 08:11.050
I'm not here to fight.

08:11.230 --> 08:13.030
Wangquan Hongye told me

08:13.420 --> 08:14.930
that if I showed you this,

08:15.360 --> 08:16.720
you would trust me.

08:31.180 --> 08:34.679
So the key to everything is at the Golden Dawn Inn.

08:35.690 --> 08:37.220
Jiuhuo is using demon lives

08:37.250 --> 08:39.929
to cultivate Golden Dawn fragments at the inn.

08:39.980 --> 08:42.179
Cuiyu Mingluan escaped from there too.

08:42.659 --> 08:44.860
She is the last piece of the Golden Dawn.

08:46.270 --> 08:48.630
That's why Jiuhuo must find her.

08:49.900 --> 08:51.310
So what's your plan?

08:52.360 --> 08:55.090
Lord Jiuhuo not only has immense demonic energy,

08:55.450 --> 08:57.850
but he's also the god of the entire Sky City.

08:58.080 --> 09:00.200
These few small external allies of yours

09:00.200 --> 09:01.440
can't take him down.

09:02.960 --> 09:05.030
Have Yang Yitan bring explosive talismans.

09:05.030 --> 09:06.240
Tomorrow, make the exchange

09:06.240 --> 09:08.170
with Jiuhuo at the Golden Dawn Inn.

09:08.440 --> 09:10.170
I not only want to take you away,

09:11.530 --> 09:12.550
but I also want to let

09:12.550 --> 09:14.360
all humans and demons in Sky City

09:15.390 --> 09:17.850
to know the true face of the fake god, Jiuhuo.

09:20.390 --> 09:22.880
Even if Lord Jiuhuo goes alone,

09:23.120 --> 09:25.580
it's still impossible to escape unscathed.

09:26.880 --> 09:27.740
It's possible.

09:28.470 --> 09:30.200
We have someone who can make him

09:31.270 --> 09:32.600
hesitate to act.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.080
And that's you.

09:40.390 --> 09:41.440
Left Guardian,

09:41.600 --> 09:43.320
Lord Jiuhuo wants you to take this prisoner

09:43.320 --> 09:45.050
to meet him at the Rebirth Pool.

09:52.730 --> 09:54.390
Even if the Golden Dawn is missing just a small piece,

09:54.390 --> 09:55.930
it's not complete

09:56.060 --> 09:57.800
and can't exert its power.

09:58.790 --> 09:59.840
I understand.

09:59.870 --> 10:02.490
Time is running out for the Seven-Star Alignment.

10:02.490 --> 10:03.750
If we miss this chance,

10:03.750 --> 10:06.130
the next time the barrier weakens

10:07.120 --> 10:09.200
will be in 100 years.

10:14.440 --> 10:15.600
Lord Jiuhuo.

10:16.670 --> 10:18.670
The three-day deadline has passed.

10:19.710 --> 10:20.970
Where are your people?

10:37.150 --> 10:39.360
It seems your life isn't that important

10:39.390 --> 10:41.080
to those little insects.

10:52.120 --> 10:53.050
Right Guardian.

10:59.240 --> 11:00.270
Lord Jiuhuo,

11:00.490 --> 11:02.150
Yang Yitan has sent a message,

11:02.270 --> 11:05.530
offering to exchange Cuiyu Mingluan for Wangquan Hongye.

11:05.530 --> 11:07.530
The location is the Golden Dawn Inn.

11:11.120 --> 11:13.440
I am willing to personally escort Wangquan Hongye

11:13.440 --> 11:14.510
for the exchange.

11:14.810 --> 11:15.940
You don't need to go.

11:17.360 --> 11:18.120
Ye Yuan.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.150
Yes.

11:19.550 --> 11:21.330
Bring Wangquan Hongye.

11:21.400 --> 11:23.940
I will go with you to the Golden Dawn Inn.

11:24.250 --> 11:25.510
-Lord Jiuhuo.
-Yes.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.360
The plan was my suggestion.

11:27.360 --> 11:28.270
Guards!

11:28.270 --> 11:28.750
My Lord.

11:28.750 --> 11:31.080
Escort the Left Guardian back to her room.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.390
She is not allowed to step out of the room.

11:33.390 --> 11:34.550
If she disobeys,

11:34.600 --> 11:36.510
inform me immediately.

11:41.600 --> 11:42.360
Yes, sir.

12:00.210 --> 12:03.640
[Golden Dawn Inn]

12:28.720 --> 12:31.120
The Cuiyu Mingluan you want is in our hands.

12:31.130 --> 12:32.530
Let's make the exchange.

12:33.080 --> 12:33.910
Is it her?

12:33.910 --> 12:35.480
This is the leech demon.

12:35.600 --> 12:36.800
Inside her body

12:37.110 --> 12:38.200
is the last piece of the Golden Dawn fragment

12:38.200 --> 12:40.360
that you want, My Lord.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.880
What exactly is this Golden Dawn?

12:44.100 --> 12:46.480
What do you use it for?

12:47.720 --> 12:48.670
You want to know?

12:50.110 --> 12:52.200
Then I shall tell you today.

12:55.830 --> 12:57.360
A thousand years ago,

12:58.200 --> 13:00.770
a hawkish demon king appeared in our clan.

13:00.800 --> 13:03.070
He had a magical artifact tied to his life force,

13:03.070 --> 13:05.370
forged from his bone marrow and blood,

13:05.470 --> 13:07.140
connected to his very soul.

13:07.390 --> 13:09.610
This artifact shimmered with light,

13:09.720 --> 13:11.510
like the gold-colored dawn,

13:12.490 --> 13:15.520
hence it was named Golden Dawn.

13:20.590 --> 13:22.000
Let me ask you a question.

13:22.210 --> 13:23.410
Do you hate me?

13:24.150 --> 13:25.510
O-Of course not.

13:28.150 --> 13:31.750
But why do I smell something delicious?

13:43.080 --> 13:44.320
Jiuhuo.

13:44.910 --> 13:47.120
You forced me to do all this.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.970
If Black Fox can

13:52.240 --> 13:53.270
feed on hatred,

13:54.000 --> 13:55.670
I should be able to as well.

14:08.730 --> 14:10.930
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred;

14:11.030 --> 14:14.330
chasing the power that can make oneself stronger.

14:14.920 --> 14:16.850
So that's what it means.

14:28.890 --> 14:30.720
The demon king was belligerent all his life

14:30.720 --> 14:33.080
and formed an irreconcilable feud with the Dragon Clan.

14:33.080 --> 14:35.430
In the end, he was surrounded by many dragons,

14:35.430 --> 14:37.710
and died on the banks of the Si River.

14:38.490 --> 14:41.590
His body sank into the Si River,

14:42.840 --> 14:44.440
while the shattered Golden Dawn

14:44.440 --> 14:46.200
flew back to our capital

14:47.150 --> 14:49.150
and slumbered in the Rebirth Pool.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.200
This golden water

14:51.790 --> 14:54.150
is the condensed water from the Si River,

14:55.670 --> 14:56.960
flowing with

14:57.440 --> 15:01.440
the blood and demonic energy of our clan's strongest demon king.

15:02.110 --> 15:04.310
So you lured great demons to Sky City

15:05.950 --> 15:07.950
and immersed them in this large vat,

15:09.360 --> 15:11.630
intending to use the power of their demon cores

15:11.630 --> 15:13.560
to reconstitute the golden water,

15:13.670 --> 15:17.130
and then form fragments of Golden Dawn to repair the artifact?

15:17.360 --> 15:18.320
Indeed.

15:19.150 --> 15:20.780
Gathering the power of many demon cores,

15:20.780 --> 15:22.830
the repaired Golden Dawn artifact

15:23.150 --> 15:24.810
will be stronger than before.

15:25.000 --> 15:26.880
You are indeed clever.

15:34.840 --> 15:38.510
Do you know what happens to those

15:39.080 --> 15:40.700
who learn my secrets?

15:41.120 --> 15:41.960
They die.

15:44.280 --> 15:46.340
Cuiyu Mingluan is still in our hands.

15:46.790 --> 15:48.200
What makes you think

15:48.200 --> 15:50.790
I want to exchange hostages with you?

15:53.790 --> 15:55.240
What makes you think I want

15:55.240 --> 15:56.920
a living leech demon?

16:18.440 --> 16:19.960
When was the seal broken?

16:20.030 --> 16:21.960
After listening to your rambling.

16:39.030 --> 16:40.280
Lord Jiuhuo.

16:40.690 --> 16:43.040
Didn't I tell you to stay in Sky City

16:43.360 --> 16:44.580
and not to leave?

16:44.720 --> 16:46.240
Where are the demon guards?

16:46.240 --> 16:47.740
I just wanted to know

16:48.080 --> 16:49.260
why you forbade me

16:49.390 --> 16:51.320
from coming to the Golden Dawn Inn.

16:51.360 --> 16:52.200
What secrets are here

16:52.200 --> 16:53.800
that I'm not allowed to know?

16:54.510 --> 16:55.510
Foolish.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.380
Let them come over,

16:58.510 --> 16:59.700
or I'll kill her.

16:59.840 --> 17:00.910
Kill her?

17:02.390 --> 17:03.580
Can you bear to do it?

17:03.750 --> 17:05.079
I'm different from you.

17:05.440 --> 17:07.569
I can do anything for the greater good.

17:08.640 --> 17:09.920
I can die with her,

17:10.119 --> 17:11.810
but I will never let her

17:12.200 --> 17:14.260
commit such a grave mistake with you.

17:19.400 --> 17:20.640
Then think about...

17:23.760 --> 17:24.700
Jia Lan.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.010
Hongye.

18:35.750 --> 18:38.720
Quzhuo's explosive talisman is really powerful.

18:38.880 --> 18:41.110
The cellar of the Golden Dawn Inn has been destroyed.

18:41.110 --> 18:44.370
I'm afraid Jiuhuo's secret can no longer be hidden.

18:49.920 --> 18:53.270
Do you think Huaizhu has remembered everything?

19:05.010 --> 19:06.360
Where are you going?

19:07.830 --> 19:09.090
Sky-breaking Temple.

19:10.720 --> 19:12.350
Also, my Third Brother and Fourth Brother

19:12.350 --> 19:14.070
are experts in magical artifacts and talismans.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.670
They must have a way to remove

19:15.750 --> 19:18.010
or suppress the demonic aura inside you.

19:20.850 --> 19:24.130
Dragon blood or dragon bone can counter Jiuhuo.

19:26.150 --> 19:29.680
This is the last piece of information I've been hiding from you.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.610
If you take me with you,

19:33.750 --> 19:36.130
Jiuhuo will relentlessly pursue you.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.510
Only if I go back

19:37.910 --> 19:39.380
will he let his guard down.

19:40.160 --> 19:40.790
Huaizhu,

19:46.160 --> 19:47.910
I will wait for you in Sky City

19:48.030 --> 19:49.960
to return with the dragon blood.

20:05.200 --> 20:06.590
Then let's set out now.

20:06.960 --> 20:08.520
What about Huaizhu?

20:09.560 --> 20:12.200
The most important thing now is to find the dragon blood

20:12.200 --> 20:13.920
and gather strength to deal with Jiuhuo.

20:13.920 --> 20:15.550
As long as Jiuhuo can't break through the Boundary,

20:15.550 --> 20:16.750
Huaizhu will be safe.

20:19.320 --> 20:20.340
I'll help too.

20:24.830 --> 20:25.590
Yitan,

20:26.020 --> 20:26.950
Young Master Mu,

20:27.200 --> 20:29.000
please come with me for a moment.

20:39.160 --> 20:41.820
If you insist on not taking me on this adventure,

20:41.880 --> 20:43.810
there's something I must tell you.

20:45.000 --> 20:45.680
Go ahead.

20:48.790 --> 20:51.250
My mother and I used to live in the mountains.

20:51.440 --> 20:53.000
After my mother passed away,

20:53.000 --> 20:54.550
I lived well on my own.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.750
The reason I came to Sky City

20:58.540 --> 21:00.160
was because I had a dream.

21:02.810 --> 21:04.740
You are the second person in the Yang family besides me

21:04.740 --> 21:06.440
who can activate the Clairvoyance Eye.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.760
And the dreams of Clairvoyance Eye

21:07.760 --> 21:09.330
all show the true future.

21:09.830 --> 21:11.230
What did you dream about?

21:19.510 --> 21:20.830
I dreamed of a person

21:22.110 --> 21:24.970
dying from gouging out their own Clairvoyance Eye.

21:26.310 --> 21:27.370
And that person...

21:28.640 --> 21:29.350
That person

21:30.880 --> 21:31.680
was me,

21:32.880 --> 21:33.480
wasn't it?

21:35.000 --> 21:36.350
My Clairvoyance is not stable.

21:36.350 --> 21:37.750
It might not be accurate.

21:38.000 --> 21:39.200
I was just worried

21:39.510 --> 21:41.440
and felt that person was familiar.

21:41.640 --> 21:44.100
That's why I came to Sky City to investigate.

21:47.670 --> 21:50.110
It's alright. I'll be as careful as I can

21:50.310 --> 21:52.510
to prevent your dream from coming true.

21:53.880 --> 21:56.400
Are you really not planning to take me with you?

21:56.400 --> 21:58.530
I might really be able to help somehow.

21:59.270 --> 22:01.600
Your mother left the Yang family back then

22:02.110 --> 22:03.960
with the purpose of severing ties with

22:03.960 --> 22:05.570
the Yiqi Alliance and us.

22:06.880 --> 22:08.790
Your surname is Mu, not Yang.

22:09.640 --> 22:11.900
You should fulfill your parents' wishes

22:12.240 --> 22:13.570
to be an ordinary person

22:14.260 --> 22:16.950
and live a long and peaceful life.

22:25.960 --> 22:26.510
Mu Mie,

22:28.000 --> 22:29.000
don't take risks.

22:29.180 --> 22:31.040
Don't get involved in conflicts.

22:31.050 --> 22:32.490
Go travel and sightsee,

22:32.520 --> 22:33.920
see the sky and the earth,

22:33.940 --> 22:34.920
and look at...

22:36.970 --> 22:37.930
real snow.

22:48.410 --> 22:49.170
Go.

23:06.810 --> 23:08.540
Future matters, future plans.

23:09.050 --> 23:10.780
I've always been open-minded.

23:18.030 --> 23:18.830
Let's go.

23:26.350 --> 23:27.610
You escaped back here?

23:29.070 --> 23:29.720
Yes.

23:30.830 --> 23:34.000
If you betrayed us, why did you come back?

23:35.550 --> 23:36.790
I didn't betray you.

23:37.880 --> 23:39.270
You defied me.

23:39.440 --> 23:41.440
As a result, you were taken hostage,

23:41.620 --> 23:44.680
allowing those little insects to escape unscathed.

23:44.960 --> 23:46.830
And you still deny it?

23:54.680 --> 23:56.030
You learned this trick

23:56.050 --> 23:59.450
of self-inflicted injury from Wangquan Hongye, didn't you?

23:59.770 --> 24:01.720
I just can't accept it.

24:01.830 --> 24:03.070
Can't accept it?

24:04.620 --> 24:07.200
I can't accept living in lies.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.350
I want to know

24:09.850 --> 24:12.450
what I really mean to you.

24:15.760 --> 24:18.930
Why did you abandon me when Wangquan Hongye

24:20.190 --> 24:21.710
mentioned Jia Lan

24:22.560 --> 24:23.980
and let them take me away?

24:42.360 --> 24:45.060
My Lord, why are you healing this traitor?

24:53.530 --> 24:55.400
I have kept things from you

24:56.310 --> 24:58.280
out of concern for you.

24:59.130 --> 25:00.550
You must understand.

25:00.570 --> 25:03.090
I didn't want you to know too much

25:03.120 --> 25:04.920
because to me,

25:06.570 --> 25:08.150
you are invaluable.

25:09.000 --> 25:10.150
Is that so?

25:12.360 --> 25:13.840
Since you want to know,

25:14.510 --> 25:16.640
I will no longer keep secrets from you.

25:17.550 --> 25:18.400
Tomorrow,

25:19.530 --> 25:22.000
I will tell you everything.

25:27.960 --> 25:28.680
Ye Yuan.

25:29.570 --> 25:30.250
Yes.

25:52.050 --> 25:53.870
This Sky-breaking Temple was already in ruins.

25:53.870 --> 25:55.200
Twenty years have passed.

25:55.200 --> 25:56.530
It hasn't changed much.

25:57.800 --> 25:59.400
Have you notified everyone?

25:59.960 --> 26:02.390
I sent letters to our brothers explaining the situation,

26:02.390 --> 26:04.770
asking them to wait for us at the Sky-breaking Temple.

26:04.770 --> 26:06.370
But so far, only the Li family

26:06.830 --> 26:07.690
has responded.

26:11.270 --> 26:13.000
Let's go inside and take a look.

26:27.370 --> 26:29.170
This place is still the same.

26:29.790 --> 26:31.400
I wonder if after 20 years,

26:31.400 --> 26:34.040
Li Quzhuo has stopped being such a chatterbox.

27:24.050 --> 27:25.320
Hongye.

27:26.900 --> 27:28.070
Quzhuo?

27:31.660 --> 27:32.630
Yitan.

27:33.810 --> 27:34.570
Qinlan.

27:36.440 --> 27:37.720
I'm not dreaming.

27:38.920 --> 27:39.590
How did you

27:41.440 --> 27:43.580
come to 20 years in the future?

27:47.270 --> 27:48.790
I'm not dreaming.

27:58.240 --> 28:00.830
Quzhuo, your leg...

28:04.850 --> 28:06.790
Why has it become like this?

28:07.790 --> 28:08.990
Where are the others?

28:21.720 --> 28:22.510
Dead.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.720
They're all dead.

28:31.710 --> 28:35.310
The Mask Group went outside the Boundary to battle the Black Fox.

28:37.390 --> 28:39.720
I was the only one who survived.

28:45.650 --> 28:48.960
I couldn't even bring back your bodies.

28:52.310 --> 28:53.440
I'm useless.

28:54.980 --> 28:56.820
Useless.

29:01.860 --> 29:02.650
How…

29:05.660 --> 29:06.860
How did everyone die?

29:09.270 --> 29:10.580
I don't remember.

29:12.710 --> 29:13.900
I don't remember.

29:15.190 --> 29:19.030
I only remember a gray haze,

29:20.480 --> 29:21.690
and a...

29:23.750 --> 29:25.000
A...

29:26.220 --> 29:27.630
A giant black tree.

29:28.430 --> 29:29.190
Yes,

29:31.100 --> 29:33.020
a giant black tree.

29:35.520 --> 29:37.920
After I approached that black tree,

29:38.140 --> 29:40.030
I couldn't remember anything.

29:40.850 --> 29:42.610
I only remember...

29:42.830 --> 29:45.850
"Since you've entered my Eternal Night,

29:46.650 --> 29:49.170
sleep here forever."

29:53.350 --> 29:54.160
Yitan

29:56.830 --> 29:58.690
sacrificed his Clairvoyance Eye

29:59.660 --> 30:01.320
to save me.

30:03.490 --> 30:05.230
I dreamed of someone

30:05.440 --> 30:08.300
dying from gouging out their own Clairvoyance Eye.

30:08.940 --> 30:10.130
And that person...

30:11.820 --> 30:12.950
Was me.

30:21.420 --> 30:23.670
Everyone died.

30:24.500 --> 30:27.230
Why am I the only one left alive?

30:29.570 --> 30:31.460
Why?

30:41.960 --> 30:42.810
Quzhuo.

30:42.880 --> 30:44.760
Hongye, Hongye,

30:45.410 --> 30:46.200
Hongye.

30:47.970 --> 30:48.880
I...

30:49.550 --> 30:51.030
I... after I came back...

30:52.440 --> 30:55.410
I spent most of my time at the Sky-breaking Temple.

30:56.150 --> 30:57.610
♪ Like a dream, like reality, like a fantasy ♪

30:56.590 --> 30:58.960
I built cenotaphs for you all.

30:58.370 --> 31:00.410
♪ At dawn and dusk ♪

31:01.160 --> 31:03.350
I know I should move on,

31:02.830 --> 31:04.360
♪ One person, one glance, one instant ♪

31:03.350 --> 31:05.920
but I can't.

31:04.990 --> 31:07.180
♪ Stop time in the beginning ♪

31:08.460 --> 31:10.320
♪ Time interlaces or somersault ♪

31:10.180 --> 31:11.640
Where are the cenotaphs?

31:11.780 --> 31:14.430
♪ Despite ups and downs, I'll never let you down ♪

31:13.680 --> 31:14.720
Take me there.

31:15.380 --> 31:19.320
♪ Follow the shadow and look out for each other in the clouds ♪

31:22.010 --> 31:23.450
♪ There's infatuation, there's love, there's hate ♪

31:24.090 --> 31:26.860
♪ Lies are hard to understand ♪

31:28.340 --> 31:29.960
♪ We won't argue ♪

31:30.110 --> 31:31.500
This is a wordless monument.

31:30.720 --> 31:32.960
♪ Faintly reflecting the beginning ♪

31:32.790 --> 31:37.100
When the task is done, we leave without seeking fame or glory.

31:34.160 --> 31:36.320
♪ Burn out the chains of darkness ♪

31:37.580 --> 31:40.270
♪ In this life, I will do all to face it with you ♪

31:38.270 --> 31:40.990
I think that's what they would have wanted.

31:40.990 --> 31:45.130
♪ Having agreed to grow old together, we now head home ♪

31:46.670 --> 31:47.930
The Mask Group

31:47.100 --> 31:48.500
♪ The long-cherished wish of this lifetime ♪

31:48.040 --> 31:50.370
was born to stop the conflict between humans and demons.

31:49.100 --> 31:50.580
♪ The meaning of the world ♪

31:51.130 --> 31:53.670
♪ Follow the light, changing with the stars ♪

31:51.420 --> 31:53.850
We put on masks and follow our hearts,

31:53.920 --> 31:57.160
casting aside prejudices between humans and demons,
walking the path of righteousness.

31:54.240 --> 31:56.870
♪ No regrets about my fate; resolute joy ♪

31:57.610 --> 32:00.460
♪ To search for the edge of the world ♪

31:58.090 --> 31:59.550
Darkness is approaching,

32:00.150 --> 32:01.700
but we chase the light.

32:01.210 --> 32:03.340
♪ Born of affection, sustained by love ♪

32:02.860 --> 32:04.210
With passion

32:04.240 --> 32:06.480
♪ Our vows will never fade ♪

32:04.570 --> 32:05.870
in our hearts,

32:06.200 --> 32:07.200
nothing in this world

32:07.120 --> 32:11.520
♪ My heart will never change ♪

32:07.880 --> 32:09.210
is impossible.

32:13.070 --> 32:13.880
This was...

32:16.840 --> 32:18.310
how many years ago?

32:20.290 --> 32:21.890
Eighteen years ago.

32:29.860 --> 32:32.520
In the end, it was my arrogance and recklessness

32:34.110 --> 32:36.000
that doomed you all.

32:37.560 --> 32:39.250
♪ There's infatuation, there's love, there's hate ♪

32:39.860 --> 32:42.150
♪ Lies are hard to understand ♪

32:44.170 --> 32:45.670
♪ We won't argue ♪

32:46.490 --> 32:48.800
♪ Faintly reflecting the beginning ♪

32:49.630 --> 32:51.770
♪ Burn out the chains of darkness ♪

32:52.890 --> 32:55.860
♪ In this life, I will do all to face it with you ♪

32:57.100 --> 33:01.520
♪ Having agreed to grow old together, we now head home ♪

33:02.580 --> 33:04.230
♪ The long-cherished wish of this lifetime ♪

33:04.880 --> 33:06.300
♪ The meaning of the world ♪

33:06.800 --> 33:09.300
♪ Follow the light, changing with the stars ♪

33:10.180 --> 33:12.590
♪ No regrets about my fate; resolute joy ♪

33:13.310 --> 33:16.150
♪ To search for the edge of the world ♪

33:16.730 --> 33:19.060
♪ Born of affection, sustained by love ♪

33:16.930 --> 33:18.470
I have three eyes,

33:18.670 --> 33:20.470
so the things I see

33:19.810 --> 33:22.260
♪ Our vows will never fade ♪

33:20.500 --> 33:23.020
are a bit more complex and clear than what you see.

33:23.020 --> 33:28.840
♪ My heart will never change ♪

33:24.280 --> 33:25.540
In this world,

33:25.730 --> 33:27.760
everything has its reason.

33:28.780 --> 33:30.920
We traveled 20 years into the future

33:31.130 --> 33:33.080
and saw our own fates.

33:31.800 --> 33:33.370
♪ Memories float up ♪

33:33.560 --> 33:35.920
We're getting closer to the truth of the Eternal Night too.

33:33.880 --> 33:35.270
♪ Clearly illuminated ♪

33:35.870 --> 33:38.370
♪ Follow the light and bid farewell to meet again ♪

33:36.610 --> 33:38.270
There's a reason for this too.

33:39.150 --> 33:41.690
♪ The passion unchanged, the devotion unbroken ♪

33:40.870 --> 33:42.010
The reason is

33:42.040 --> 33:43.940
we will definitely change all of this.

33:42.350 --> 33:45.270
♪ To break through the dark boundary ♪

33:44.590 --> 33:46.790
Yes, we can go back,

33:45.740 --> 33:48.080
♪ The deep love is like fire ♪

33:46.810 --> 33:48.460
start everything over,

33:48.480 --> 33:49.940
and change all of this.

33:48.950 --> 33:51.330
♪ Swear to reverse the prophecy and ending ♪

33:51.510 --> 33:54.070
Quzhuo, you can repair our magical artifacts

33:51.870 --> 33:56.760
♪ My heart will burn through the eternal night ♪

33:54.110 --> 33:55.330
and send us back.

33:55.500 --> 33:56.260
This

33:57.070 --> 33:58.750
is the meaning of your survival.

33:58.720 --> 34:05.760
♪ My heart remains bright for you ♪

34:00.240 --> 34:01.030
Yes.

34:02.790 --> 34:04.590
I've lived until now

34:05.250 --> 34:07.050
just to be able to help you all.
